[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4331.91, "timestamp": "01:12:11", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4335.89, "timestamp": "01:12:15", "text": "あ、すみません。あなたに電話するつもりはなかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4338.79, "timestamp": "01:12:18", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4345.51, "timestamp": "01:12:25", "text": "なぜこれが大衆なのか？愛してます。わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4348.31, "timestamp": "01:12:28", "text": "どうすれば"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4358.229, "timestamp": "01:12:38", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4360.27, "timestamp": "01:12:40", "text": "わかった。待って。えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4362.39, "timestamp": "01:12:42", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4367.11, "timestamp": "01:12:47", "text": "それから、私も行かなければならない。ああ、神様。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4369.51, "timestamp": "01:12:49", "text": "悪い方向へ進まないことを願います"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4372.31, "timestamp": "01:12:52", "text": "これを行った結果、ルートが変更されました。私は怖いです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4374.47, "timestamp": "01:12:54", "text": "けれど。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4375.99, "timestamp": "01:12:55", "text": "今回は一緒に時間を過ごしましょう。"}]